{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121349","id":4877891092,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7xSADX","number":121349,"title":"GDScript: Fix temporary cleanup after typed default arguments","user":{"login":"rathodkunj2005","id":86590228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTkwMjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86590228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005","html_url":"https://github.com/rathodkunj2005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rathodkunj2005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-13T21:49:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T07:45:22Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T07:45:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121349","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121349","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121349.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121349.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nGDScript's bytecode generator pools all reference-counted temporary types in the same stack-slot pool. The slot's `can_contain_object` metadata was only initialized when the slot was first created, so a slot first used by a typed `Array[String]` default argument remained marked as unable to contain objects when it was later reused for a `RefCounted` method-chain temporary. As a result, the temporary was not cleared at the end of the statement.\n\n- Closes #121316\n\n## Additional information\n\nThis updates the slot metadata whenever a pooled temporary slot is reused, so end-of-statement cleanup reflects its current value. A GDScript integration regression test compares untyped and typed-array default arguments and verifies that both release the chained `RefCounted` before the following statement.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `python3 -m SCons platform=macos target=template_debug dev_build=yes vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no disable_path_overrides=no tests=yes -j4` — build succeeded.\n- Focused headless reproduction using the built engine — both untyped and typed-default cases printed `released` before their following `after ...` marker.\n- `git diff --cached --check` — passed before commit.\n\n**AI disclosure:** This contribution was implemented and tested by an autonomous AI coding agent on behalf of @rathodkunj2005. The agent inspected the issue, traced the temporary-slot metadata reuse, authored the focused fix and regression test, and ran the verification above.\n","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121349/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}